[198.33263, "o", "\r\nLibMambaUnsatisfiableError: Encountered problems while solving:\r\n  - nothing provides __cuda needed by pytorch-1.12.0-cuda102py310hdf4a2db_200\r\n\r\nCould not solve for environment specs\r\nThe following packages are incompatible\r\n├─ \u001b[32mpython =3.10 *\u001b[0m is installable with the potential options\r\n│  ├─ \u001b[32mpython [3.10.10|3.10.11]\u001b[0m would require\r\n│  │  ├─ \u001b[32mopenssl >=3.1.0,<4.0a0 *\u001b[0m, which can be installed;\r\n│  │  └─ \u001b[32mpython_abi =3.10 *_cp310\u001b[0m, which can be installed;\r\n│  ├─ \u001b[32mpython 3.10.12\u001b[0m would require\r\n│  │  ├─ \u001b[32mopenssl >=3.1.1,<4.0a0 *\u001b[0m, which can be installed;\r\n│  │  └─ \u001b[32mpython_abi =3.10 *_cp310\u001b[0m, which can be installed;\r\n│  ├─ \u001b[32mpython 3.10.13\u001b[0m would require\r\n│  │  ├─ \u001b[32mopenssl >=3.1.4,<4.0a0 *\u001b[0m, which can be installed;\r\n│  │  └─ \u001b[32mpython_abi =3.10 *_cp310\u001b[0m, which can be installed;\r\n│  ├─ \u001b[32mpython 3.10.13\u001b[0m would require\r\n│  │  ├─ \u001b[32mopenssl >=3.2.0,<4.0a0 *"]
